{"seq":2,"slug":"physical-chemical-treatment","title":"大学环境工程 — 物理化学处理：混凝、沉淀与过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/water-pollution-control/physical-chemical-treatment","wordCount":1745,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学环境工程-物理化学处理-混凝-沉淀与过滤\">大学环境工程 — 物理化学处理：混凝、沉淀与过滤</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>物理化学处理是污水处理流水线上&quot;看得见&quot;的部分，主要任务是去除水中的悬浮物和胶体颗粒。大颗粒（如泥沙）靠重力自然沉降就能去除，但水中真正难缠的是<strong>胶体</strong>——那些直径在纳米到微米级、肉眼看不见、却能让水浑浊不清的微小颗粒。它们因为表面带同种电荷而相互排斥，悬浮在水中几年都不沉降。</p>\n<p>对付胶体的核心武器是<strong>混凝（coagulation &amp; flocculation）</strong>：投加化学药剂中和胶体表面的电荷，让它们能够相互靠近、聚集成大颗粒（称为&quot;矾花&quot;），再通过沉淀和过滤去除。混凝—沉淀—过滤这一组合，是自来水厂和污水厂物理化学段的标准配置，理解它就理解了&quot;水变清&quot;的物理化学机理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"胶体为什么不沉降\">胶体为什么不沉降</h3><p>水中胶体的稳定性来自两个因素：一是颗粒太小，重力作用微乎其微；二是颗粒表面带电（多数为负电），同种电荷相互排斥。这层电荷在颗粒周围形成&quot;双电层&quot;，使颗粒之间始终保持距离，无法聚集长大。这就好比一群带同种磁极的小磁铁，越靠近排斥力越大，永远凑不到一起。</p>\n<p>颗粒的沉降速度由 <strong>Stokes 定律</strong>描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{g \\, d^2 (\\rho_p - \\rho_w)}{18 \\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3715em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是颗粒直径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是颗粒和水的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是水的粘度。关键洞见是：沉降速度与颗粒直径的<strong>平方</strong>成正比。这意味着把颗粒直径放大 10 倍，沉降速度就提升 100 倍。混凝的全部意义，就是把小胶体&quot;撮合&quot;成大矾花，从而让 Stokes 定律站在我们这边。</p>\n<h3 id=\"混凝的两个阶段\">混凝的两个阶段</h3><p>混凝在工程上分为两步，由两种不同机理主导：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>机理</th>\n<th>工程操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>凝聚</td>\n<td>Coagulation</td>\n<td>中和电荷、压缩双电层</td>\n<td>快速搅拌（几十秒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>絮凝</td>\n<td>Flocculation</td>\n<td>颗粒架桥、聚集长大</td>\n<td>慢速搅拌（10–30 分钟）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>凝聚</strong>阶段投加混凝剂（最常用的是硫酸铝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Al_2(SO_4)_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和聚合氯化铝 PAC），药剂水解产生的正电荷离子中和胶体的负电荷，消除排斥力。这一步需要<strong>快速搅拌</strong>，让药剂瞬间均匀分散。</p>\n<p><strong>絮凝</strong>阶段则需要<strong>慢速搅拌</strong>。此时投加助凝剂（如聚丙烯酰胺 PAM，一种高分子长链），它像&quot;绳子&quot;一样把已经失稳的小颗粒架桥连接起来，形成肉眼可见的大矾花。搅拌太快会把刚长好的矾花打碎，所以必须温柔。这种&quot;先快后慢&quot;的搅拌策略是混凝工艺的精髓。</p>\n<h3 id=\"沉淀-让矾花落下来\">沉淀：让矾花落下来</h3><p>矾花形成后进入沉淀池，靠重力分离。常见的沉淀池有平流式、辐流式、竖流式，以及效率更高的斜板/斜管沉淀池。衡量沉淀池性能的核心参数是<strong>表面负荷率（surface loading rate）</strong>，又称溢流率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = \\frac{Q}{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是处理水量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是沉淀池表面积。它的物理意义等价于颗粒的临界沉降速度——只有沉降速度大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的颗粒才能被有效去除。这解释了一个反直觉的结论：<strong>沉淀池的去除效率取决于表面积，而与池深无关</strong>。正是基于这个原理，斜板沉淀池通过增加多层斜板大幅扩大有效沉淀面积，在同样占地下把处理能力提升数倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过滤-最后的把关\">过滤：最后的把关</h3><p>沉淀出水仍残留少量细小矾花，过滤是把关的最后一道工序。最经典的是<strong>快滤池</strong>，水流自上而下穿过石英砂滤层，颗粒被截留在砂粒之间的孔隙中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[混凝剂投加] --&gt; B[快速混合&lt;br/&gt;凝聚]&#10;    B --&gt; C[絮凝池&lt;br/&gt;慢速搅拌]&#10;    C --&gt; D[沉淀池&lt;br/&gt;重力分离]&#10;    D --&gt; E[砂滤池&lt;br/&gt;过滤]&#10;    E --&gt; F[清水]\">graph TD\n    A[混凝剂投加] --&gt; B[快速混合&lt;br/&gt;凝聚]\n    B --&gt; C[絮凝池&lt;br/&gt;慢速搅拌]\n    C --&gt; D[沉淀池&lt;br/&gt;重力分离]\n    D --&gt; E[砂滤池&lt;br/&gt;过滤]\n    E --&gt; F[清水]</pre><p>过滤一段时间后，砂层孔隙被截留物堵塞，水头损失增大，需要<strong>反冲洗</strong>——用清水自下而上高速冲刷，把截留的污泥带走，恢复滤层功能。一座自来水厂的运行节奏，很大程度上就是由滤池的&quot;过滤—反冲洗&quot;循环决定的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个真实尺度的例子\">一个真实尺度的例子</h3><p>某自来水厂处理量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50000</mn><msup><mtext> m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>d</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = 50000 \\text{ m}^3/\\text{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span>，设计表面负荷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><msup><mtext> m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>h</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = 1.5 \\text{ m}^3/(\\text{m}^2 \\cdot \\text{h})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。先把日处理量换算为小时：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>24</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2083</mn><msup><mtext> m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50000 / 24 \\approx 2083 \\text{ m}^3/\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50000/24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2083</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span>。所需沉淀池表面积为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2083</mn><mn>1.5</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1389</mn><msup><mtext> m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{Q}{q} = \\frac{2083}{1.5} \\approx 1389 \\text{ m}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2083</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1389</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这相当于约 3.5 个标准篮球场的面积——可见水处理设施的&quot;大块头&quot;从何而来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用 Stokes 定律解释：为什么混凝把颗粒直径增大是提高沉降效率最有效的手段？把直径增大 5 倍，沉降速度提升多少倍？</li>\n<li>混凝为什么要&quot;先快速搅拌、后慢速搅拌&quot;？如果整个过程都用快速搅拌会发生什么？</li>\n<li>有人认为把沉淀池修得更深就能去除更多颗粒，请用表面负荷率的概念反驳这个观点。</li>\n<li>斜板沉淀池为什么能在不增加占地的情况下提高处理能力？它改变了 Stokes 公式中的哪个变量、又改变了沉淀池的哪个关键参数？</li>\n<li>某沉淀池处理量 30000 m³/d，表面负荷 2.0 m³/(m²·h)，求所需表面积。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《给水排水工程》（高等教育出版社）——国内给排水专业的经典教材，混凝沉淀章节讲解透彻</li>\n<li>可观察一个简单家庭实验：往浑浊的泥水里加少量明矾并搅拌，几分钟后泥沙结块沉底，这就是最直观的混凝演示</li>\n<li>了解&quot;聚合氯化铝（PAC）&quot;如何在近几十年逐步取代传统硫酸铝，背后是混凝剂技术的演进</li>\n<li>AWWA（美国水工程协会）发布的《Water Treatment Plant Design》——给水厂设计的权威参考</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>物理化学处理的核心矛盾是胶体因带电而稳定悬浮。混凝通过&quot;凝聚（中和电荷）+ 絮凝（架桥聚集）&quot;把小胶体变成大矾花，从而让 Stokes 定律帮我们快速沉降。沉淀池的去除效率由表面负荷率决定，与池深无关，这是斜板沉淀池的设计依据。过滤作为最后把关，依靠&quot;过滤—反冲洗&quot;循环持续运行。掌握了这套物理化学手段后，下一节我们进入污水处理真正的&quot;心脏&quot;——生物处理，看看微生物如何吃掉那些物理化学方法无能为力的溶解性有机物。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学环境工程 — 物理化学处理：混凝、沉淀与过滤","id":"大学环境工程-物理化学处理-混凝-沉淀与过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"胶体为什么不沉降","id":"胶体为什么不沉降"},{"level":3,"text":"混凝的两个阶段","id":"混凝的两个阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"沉淀：让矾花落下来","id":"沉淀-让矾花落下来"},{"level":3,"text":"过滤：最后的把关","id":"过滤-最后的把关"},{"level":3,"text":"一个真实尺度的例子","id":"一个真实尺度的例子"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学环境工程 — 水质指标与污水处理总体框架","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/water-pollution-control/water-quality-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"大学环境工程 — 生物处理：活性污泥法与生物膜法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/water-pollution-control/biological-treatment"}}